# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RosiFit credentials. Copy to apps/rosifit/.env (gitignored — the ONLY place
# credentials are read from). The PIN signs in to a REAL account on the live
# app; never commit it, paste it into a flow, or put it in a chat.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- admin: the super admin (mobile number + 4-digit PIN) — read-only ---------
SIGNIN_MOBILE=
SIGNIN_PIN=

# --- staff (optional): flows with auth: staff are skipped until both are set --
# STAFF_MOBILE=
# STAFF_PIN=

# --- Pinned records (optional) -----------------------------------------------
# FIXED_COURSE_ID=
# FIXED_MEMBER_ID=

# --- Local clone of github.com/UniqBrio/RosiFit ------------------------------
# Used by the capture skip filter AND by `npm run coverage` / `audit:coverage`.
# Forward slashes, no quotes on Windows.
# APP_REPO_PATH=
# APP_REPO_BRANCH=main
